  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Energy Sphere (blast shape)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using the Energy Sphere blast shape, you may spend 1 spell point to form the energy sphere into a serpent, which grows with every target it damages. Whenever the energy sphere successfully deals damage to a target, its size increases by 1&nbsp;5-foot square. When moving the energy sphere each round, its squares must be arranged contiguously in an arrangement that follows the movement of the ‘head’ of the serpent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/destruction#toc120\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
